OL,3,GNEWSAElectricity link could be restored
OL,4,Anext month ahead of winter peak
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's electricity link
OL,7,Fwith Great Britain could be restored to
OL,8,Ffull capacity next month, its owners
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FThe undersea Moyle Interconnector has
OL,12,Fdeveloped a fault which has halved its
OL,13,Fcapacity to import power from Great
OL,14,FBritain.
OL,16,FMutual Energy said it has identified a
OL,17,Fproblem with onshore equipment rather
OL,18,Fthan with the undersea cable.
OL,20,FThey have published an estimated return
OL,21,Fto service date of 13 December, based
OL,22,Fon their investigations and work plans.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
